<p class="small">Separate API proposal: <a href="https://github.com/dinkuskit/dinkuskit/pull/130">exact-size catalog lookup #130</a> · <a href="https://github.com/saarius/dinkuskit/tree/fix/catalog-exact-availability">fork d0b72c8</a>. The available-only request returned an empty product for a sold-out size; the repair reports that exact input as not found. All 37 owning local verification stages pass across serial runs after an unchanged dev-server retry; CI and review are pending. The actual store feed remains empty under its existing channel-eligibility contract; no shared catalog is deployed.</p>
